    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Connexion administrateur : refus et succes",
      "description": "Mesure sur les metriques HTTP existantes, cote SERVICE : l'etiquette uri y est le gabarit concret. Au Gateway elle vaut le motif de route (/api/v1/auth-sdk/**), ou /auth/admin/login est indistinguable de /auth/login.",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=\"/auth/admin/login\",status=\"401\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "refus / min",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=\"/auth/admin/login\",status=\"200\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "succes / min",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Appels sur /admin/** par statut",
      "description": "401 et 403 : un jeton d'utilisateur final n'a aucune raison de frapper /admin/**. 5xx : une operation d'administration qui echoue laisse l'administrateur dans le doute sur ce qui a ete fait.",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri=~\"/admin/.*\"}[5m])) by (status) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
